# Item 49 — armed replay snapshots.
# Each carries the pool's accounts AND the swap programs' full ELF, so one file
# is tens of megabytes. It is working state for a two-phase run, not evidence:
# the evidence is artifacts/replay-calibrate.json, which records what the replay
# concluded and refuses to be produced without provenance.
artifacts/replay-armed/

# Phase H Dune results. 86 MB, 36 MB and 22 MB of raw rows, which is not a thing to put
# in a repository. They regenerate from the committed SQL in ops/dune/generated at the
# credit cost recorded in docs/PHASE_H_REPORT.md, and what a reader needs from them is
# committed as artifacts/phase-h-mint-venues.csv and artifacts/phase-h-venue.json.
/ops/dune/results/q16-venue-*.json
/ops/dune/results/q17-program-*.json
